Output demo/hop.gif

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1240
Set Height 640
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "GitHub Dark"
Set TypingSpeed 70ms

Hide
Type "export HOME=/tmp/hop-demo-home XDG_CACHE_HOME=/tmp/hop-demo-home/.cache PATH=$PWD:$PATH" Enter
Type "python3 demo/make-home.py $HOME && source ./hop.zsh && cd ~/code/storefront && hop index >/dev/null && hop label && clear" Enter
Sleep 6s
Show

Type "hop" Enter
Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 1.5s
Up
Sleep 1s
Type "refund"
Sleep 2s
Ctrl+U
Sleep 500ms
Type "where did we stop charging people twice"
Sleep 800ms
Alt+Enter
Sleep 4.5s
Tab
Sleep 2.5s
Tab
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 2s
